{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02747","headline":"中和乐九章 歌东军第三 · 卢照邻","name":"中和乐九章 歌东军第三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遐哉庙畧，赫矣台臣。\n横戈碣石，倚劒浮津。\n风丘拂箨，日域清尘。\n岛夷复祀，龙伯来宾。\n休兵宇县，献馘天闉。\n斾海凯入，耀辉震震。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02747.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02747","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}